1. Company Overview 
Luxury Concept Perfumes Manufacturing LLC is a Dubai-based fragrance manufacturer established in 2010, specializing in private label perfume development, contract manufacturing, and branded fragrance collections. Operating from Dubai Investment Park (DIP), the company integrates fragrance formulation, manufacturing, quality control, packaging, warehousing, and logistics within a single facility. Its multidisciplinary team includes in-house perfumers, formulation specialists, designers, procurement professionals, and QA/QC personnel, supported by an established network of fragrance oil and packaging suppliers. Luxury Concept has partnered in the development and manufacturing of more than 100 fragrance brands across regional and international markets, supporting businesses ranging from emerging entrepreneurs and independent retailers to established distributors and consumer brands. The manufacturing facility maintains ready stock of essential production components, including bottles, caps, pumps, cartons, and other packaging materials, enabling efficient production planning and reduced lead times where applicable. Certified under ISO and GMP standards, the company operates an in-house laboratory dedicated to fragrance development, formulation refinement, and quality assurance. Luxury Concept has also participated in Beautyworld Middle East 2023, reflecting its active presence within the regional fragrance industry. Alongside its manufacturing services, Luxury Concept develops and manages its own fragrance brands, including Luxury Concept, Rifaat, Bon Milano and Alberto each representing a distinct creative direction. The facility has a production capacity of approximately 500,000 units per month, with a standard minimum order quantity of 500 units per fragrance reference.
