2. Brand Story
Luxury Concept was established in Dubai in 2010 as a perfume manufacturing facility with a clear commercial objective: to develop and manufacture fragrances for established brands and international export markets. Founded by four partners, the company focused on building reliable production capabilities, consistent quality, and long-term manufacturing relationships from the outset. As the business expanded, so did the understanding of the evolving fragrance market. Recognizing the growing demand for private label development, Luxury Concept broadened its capabilities beyond manufacturing to support entrepreneurs, retailers, distributors, and emerging perfume brands through end-to-end product development. In 2012, the company introduced its own retail fragrance line, marking the beginning of its branded portfolio while continuing to strengthen its manufacturing division. Over the years, the company invested in in-house perfumers, formulation expertise, laboratory facilities, quality management systems, and an integrated production environment. These developments enabled Luxury Concept to support every stage of fragrance creation, from concept and formulation to packaging, production, and logistics. The company achieved ISO and GMP certification in 2022, reinforcing its commitment to structured manufacturing and quality assurance. Today, Luxury Concept has partnered in the development and manufacturing of more than 100 fragrance brands across regional and international markets. Alongside its manufacturing business, it continues to expand its own portfolio through distinct fragrance identities such as Rifaat and Bon Milano, while introducing creative collections like The Cosmos Collection to explore new directions in olfactory design. Since its founding, one principle has remained unchanged: helping brands transform ideas into commercially viable fragrance products through consistent quality, reliable manufacturing, and long-term partnership.
